      "extract": "The Hamiltonian used in this review use includes nonrelativistic kinetic energy, the AV18 $N\\!N$ potential [@WSS95] and either the Urbana IX [@PPCW95] or one of the new Illinois series of $N\\!N\\!$ potential [@PPWC01]: $$H = \\sum_{i} K_{i} + \\sum_{i<j} v_{ij} + \\sum_{i<j<k} V_{ijk} \\ . \\label{eq:H}$$ The kinetic energy operator has charge-independent (CI) and charge-symmetry-breaking (CSB) components, the latter due",
      "extractCut": true
    },
